   "annotation_text": "At Visit 8 (week 26) in order to collect pre-dose samples for PK and PD, participants should take their study drug at the site only after blood sampling. The investigator must record the time when the study drug is taken at the site. A phone call to remind the participants is recommended. However, in case Visit 8 is also the EOT visit as well as in case the sample is taken at ET visit, no study drug will be administered.",
